  "execution_notes": [
    "GitHub draft lookup through releases/tags/v0.81 returned 404. Publication succeeded; all seven uploaded asset hashes were compared successfully immediately after publication. The staged remote-digest check did not complete before publication.",
    "The gh release edit operation succeeded; a subsequent local shell bookkeeping command failed without changing the release. The resulting published release was independently retrieved and verified.",
    "Zenodo accepted the published event with HTTP 202; its duplicate released event returned HTTP 409, The release has already been received. The published record and archive were subsequently verified.",
    "The GitHub and Zenodo ZIP bytes differ because GitHub adds an archive root directory and archive metadata; every archived file matches the approved source and the ZIP commit comment matches the approved commit.",
    "The source and prepublication evidence archives remain frozen. This external record adds observed publication and archival facts after release."
  ],
